{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","title":"Napa Valley Nails Salon | 加州纳帕美甲：手部护理、足部护理与水晶甲","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">跳到主要内容</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NV</span><span>Napa Valley Nails Salon</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a><a href=\"#services\">服务</a><a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a><a href=\"#gallery\">照片</a><a href=\"#reviews\">评价</a><a href=\"#visit\">营业时间和地址</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"语言\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" selected>中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\">致电</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/salon-interior.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">美甲店 · 纳帕 Trancas St</p>\n    <h1>Napa Valley Nails Salon</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">在 Trancas Street 做手部美甲、足部护理、光疗、浸粉和水晶甲，我们亲切的团队多年来深受老顾客信赖。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · Google 上的 69 条评价<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 来电预约</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%2C%20706%20Trancas%20St%2C%20Ste%20A%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 导航</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">69 条评价，4.8★</a></li><li>欢迎直接到店</li><li>手部美甲与足部护理</li><li>光疗、浸粉与水晶甲</li><li>美甲彩绘</li><li>接受信用卡</li><li>私人停车场</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">关于本店</p><h2>干净、亲切、放松。</h2><p>Napa Valley Nails Salon 是位于纳帕 706 Trancas Street 的全方位美甲店，为女士和男士提供手部美甲、足部护理、光疗甲、浸粉甲、水晶甲、延长甲和美甲彩绘。</p><p>我们店里干净卫生，颜色选择非常多，老顾客总是回来做放松的足部护理、足底按摩，还有轻薄自然的水晶甲。我们的美甲师有 Ann、Lee、Joe、Kenny、Kevin 和 Kim。</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>69 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Nextdoor</b><span>街坊最爱</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>6 天</b><span>周一至周六营业</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/red-manicure.jpg\" alt=\"刚做好的红色美甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">价目</p><h2>服务项目</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>手部美甲</h3></div><p>经典手部护理，也有男士手部护理。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>足部护理</h3></div><p>放松的足部护理和足底按摩。也有男士足部护理。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>手足护理套餐</h3></div><p>一次到店，手脚一起做。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>光疗甲</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>浸粉甲</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>水晶甲</h3></div><p>轻薄自然的水晶甲，街坊们说能保持 3–4 周不翘边。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>光疗延长甲与延长甲</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>美甲彩绘</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>指甲油</h3></div><p>颜色选择非常多。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">10</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>蜜蜡脱毛</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">11</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>皮肤护理</h3></div></article></div><p class=\"note\">本店价格未在网上公布。请致电 (707) 252-4551 了解最新价格。</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">温馨提示</p><h2>温馨提示</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>欢迎直接到店</b><span>想指定美甲师，最好提前来电</span></li><li><b>接受信用卡</b></li><li><b>私人停车场</b></li><li><b>自行车停放处</b></li><li><b>无性别洗手间</b></li><li><b>男士服务</b><span>男士手部和足部护理</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">相册</p><h2>近期作品</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/gel-colors.jpg\" alt=\"多彩光疗美甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/red-nail-art.jpg\" alt=\"红色彩绘美甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/silver-glitter.jpg\" alt=\"银色亮片美甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-red.jpg\" alt=\"经典红色美甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lace-nails.jpg\" alt=\"白色长甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lilac-gel.jpg\" alt=\"淡紫色光疗甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/natural-nude.jpg\" alt=\"自然裸色美甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lavender-nails.jpg\" alt=\"薰衣草色美甲\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">荣誉</p><h2>街坊推荐</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“NAPA Valley Nails is a Neighborhood Favorite in 1 neighborhood. It also won in 2020, 2022 and 2023.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Nextdoor Fave Awards</b> · Nextdoor Neighborhood Favorite · <a href=\"https://nextdoor.com/pages/napa-valley-nails-napa-ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">评价</p><h2>顾客怎么说</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 69 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Love 💕 this nail salon. The team does a great job (just what I ask for) and are welcoming and can almost always fit me in at the last minute. Thank you Ann for years of service and friendship.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“The nail salon employees here are very nice, and take good care of your nails. They give great massages and are hygienic.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My wife and I both got a nice relaxing pedicure on vacation! I mean, when she uses that buffer kind of roughly, I&#39;m crawling up the back of the chair... But my feet feel so nice now! The foot massage was wonderful. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Lee did an exceptional service, my feet are so clean, relaxed and painted! I’m so excited they look great! I’m falling asleep being so comfortable and relaxed I couldn’t help it!! I’m coming back for more !!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/napa/napa-valley-nails-salon-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“They did a wonderful job, charge very reasonably, and do a great acrylics.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Ann did my pedicure and my manicure! Not only did she do such a stunning job, she was so sweet and kind. I really enjoyed our time together and our little chats :) she’s an absolute doll and truly made my nail appointment an experience. Please please please go here and ask for her if she’s in! Calling ahead is a good idea to make sure she can take you. Thank you, Ann!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have finally made Napa Valley Nails my place !! My experience has always been pleasurable. Anna is so sweet and does an amazing and detailed job.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2019</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I just went to this shop yesterday and will definitely be coming back! This place is so clean and carries a huge variety of colors to choose from. My nail tech Anna did an amazing job. She was very kind and pleasant to me. I absolutely love it here and will come back very soon.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2019</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>需要预约吗？</summary><p>欢迎直接到店，临时过来我们几乎总能安排。想指定美甲师的话，请提前致电 (707) 252-4551。</p></details><details><summary>你们提供哪些服务？</summary><p>手部美甲、足部护理、光疗甲、浸粉甲、水晶甲、光疗延长甲和普通延长甲、美甲彩绘和指甲油，以及男士手足护理。服务列表中也包括蜜蜡脱毛和皮肤护理。</p></details><details><summary>营业时间是什么时候？</summary><p>周一至周五上午 9:30 至下午 6:30，周六上午 9:30 至下午 6 点。周日休息。</p></details><details><summary>你们在哪里？</summary><p>我们在 706 Trancas St, Suite A, Napa, CA 94558，有私人停车场。</p></details><details><summary>收信用卡吗？</summary><p>收，我们接受信用卡。</p></details><details><summary>服务价格是多少？</summary><p>我们的价格没有放在网上，但一直很实惠。请致电 (707) 252-4551 了解最新价格。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">欢迎光临</p>\n      <h2>营业时间和地址</h2>\n      <address>706 Trancas St, Ste A<br>Napa, CA 94558</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\">(707) 252-4551</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>星期一</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>星期二</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>星期三</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>星期四</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>星期五</td><td>9:30 AM – 6:30 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>星期六</td><td>9:30 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>星期日</td><td>休息</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">欢迎直接到店。想指定美甲师请来电预约。</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/1144273802310676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 致电</a>